{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":7964,"ns":0,"title":"Definition","extract":"A definition is a semantic statement of the meaning of a term (a word, phrase, or other set of symbols). Definitions can be classified into two large categories: intensional definitions (which try to give the sense of a term), and extensional definitions (which try to list the objects that a term describes).","description":"Statement that attaches a meaning to a term","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}